E1 proposal 1/2: what Electron and Node need from Kernel64 and the Win64 runtime

kernel32: CancelSynchronousIo, CreateSymbolicLinkW, ReOpenFile, GetProcessIoCounters, GetErrorMode, NeedCurrentDirectoryForExePathW,
GetCurrentPackageFullName, GetPackageFamilyName; console cursor/title/fill/input model; WriteConsoleW no longer drops the last byte;
CreateNamedPipeW accepts the verbatim \\?\pipe\ prefix. ntdll: RtlAddGrowableFunctionTable, RtlGrowFunctionTable,
RtlDeleteGrowableFunctionTable. ws2_32: GetNameInfoW. advapi32: SystemFunction036. kernel64: the NUL device, FileAllInformation.


